THIRD-PARTY SCOPE
The real_subset files select and transform upstream WorldMove v1 and ChinaHighO3 H1K 2019 v1 material. They retain their existing source CC BY 4.0 terms and source attributions; no original ownership of those datasets is claimed. The subset metadata and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md record creators, source DOIs and transformations. Preserve those notices alongside attribution to this study. Whole upstream products and third-party GIS layers are not included.

